      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When developing this module, focus instead on teaching scenario-based de-escalation techniques applicable to all interactions rather than stereotyping specific groups. Provide training on recognizing universal high-stress indicators, such as agitated body language, heightened vocal tone, or avoidance behaviors, regardless of the individual's background. Grounding the training in observable, neutral communication patterns will help officers build empathetic and effective responses across diverse communities. This approach promotes unbiased, situationally aware policing.",
